Cludgy, but this datatable-test.R works:

assign(".Depends", "data.table", envir = topenv())
TESTDT = data.table(a=as.integer(c(1,3,4,4,4,4,7)),
                    b=as.integer(c(5,5,6,6,9,9,2)),
                    v=1:7)
setkey(TESTDT,a,b)
x <- TESTDT[SJ(4,6), v, mult="first"]

- Tom

